    },
    {
      "name": "Work Surface",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "work-surface",
      "description": "The flat cool-paper container for a task, draft or inspectable result.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-work-surface\"><h2>Текуща задача</h2><p>Опиши целта, прегледай черновата и запази полезния резултат.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-work-surface{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif);padding:31px 34px 24px;border-radius:14px;background:#f3f4f6;color:#20242c;box-shadow:none}.ds-work-surface h2{font-size:clamp(23px,2.1vw,30px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:730;margin:0 0 14px}.ds-work-surface p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#4c4e55;max-width:48ch;margin:0 0 24px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-work-surface{padding:24px 22px;border-radius:12px}}"
    },
    {
