      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "The four direct home choices. Large labels and decorative Phosphor icons replace miniature interface thumbnails on phones.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-destinations\" aria-label=\"Какво искаш да постигнеш\"><button class=\"ds-destination\" data-goal=\"content\" data-preview=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>Съдържание</strong><span>Публикации, сценарии и идеи.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"ds-mobileSymbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M216,40H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,56V200a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V56A16,16,0,0,0,216,40Zm0,160H40V56H216V200ZM184,96a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H80a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h96A8,8,0,0,1,184,96Zm0,32a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H80a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h96A8,8,0,0,1,184,128Zm0,32a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H80a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h96A8,8,0,0,1,184,160Z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"ds-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"ds-destination\" data-goal=\"business\" data-preview=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>Моят бизнес</strong><span>Сайт, оферта или ясен план.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"ds-mobileSymbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M216,40H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,56V200a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V56A16,16,0,0,0,216,40Zm0,16V88H40V56Zm0,144H40V104H216v96Z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"ds-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"ds-destination\" data-goal=\"automation\" data-preview=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>По-малко рутина</strong><span>Подреди повтарящите се задачи.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"ds-mobileSymbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H128a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h88A8,8,0,0,1,224,128ZM128,72h88a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H128a8,8,0,0,0,0,16Zm88,112H128a8,8,0,0,0,0,16h88a8,8,0,0,0,0-16ZM82.34,42.34,56,68.69,45.66,58.34A8,8,0,0,0,34.34,69.66l16,16a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l32-32A8,8,0,0,0,82.34,42.34Zm0,64L56,132.69,45.66,122.34a8,8,0,0,0-11.32,11.32l16,16a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l32-32a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32Zm0,64L56,196.69,45.66,186.34a8,8,0,0,0-11.32,11.32l16,16a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l32-32a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32Z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"ds-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"ds-destination\" data-goal=\"focus\" data-preview=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>Фокус и навици</strong><span>Отдели време за важната задача.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"ds-mobileSymbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M221.87,83.16A104.1,104.1,0,1,1,195.67,49l22.67-22.68a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32l-96,96a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32l27.72-27.72a40,40,0,1,0,17.87,31.09,8,8,0,1,1,16-.9,56,56,0,1,1-22.38-41.65L184.3,60.39a87.88,87.88,0,1,0,23.13,29.67,8,8,0,0,1,14.44-6.9Z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"ds-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z\"></path></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-destinations{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif);--entry-ink:#15171b;--entry-muted:#61646d;--entry-accent:#cf352c}\n.ds-destinations{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}\n.ds-destination{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;gap:24px;padding:25px 0;text-align:left;background:none;color:var(--entry-ink);border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #dadddf;border-radius:0;position:relative;min-height:104px}\n.ds-destination:first-child{border-top:1px solid #dadddf}\n.ds-copy{display:block;min-width:0}.ds-copy>strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(23px,2.2vw,30px);font-weight:650;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-copy>span{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px;color:var(--entry-muted)}\n.ds-arrow{flex-shrink:0;color:#737780}.ds-destination[data-preview=true] .ds-arrow,.ds-destination[data-preview=true] .ds-copy>strong{color:var(--entry-accent)}\n.ds-mobileSymbol{display:none}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){\n .ds-arrow{transition:color 160ms ease,transform 180ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-destination:hover .ds-arrow{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}\n .ds-copy{transition:transform 180ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-destination:is(:hover,:focus-visible) .ds-copy{transform:translateX(4px)}\n}\n@media(max-width:760px){.ds-destination{min-height:109px;padding:25px 0;gap:12px}.ds-copy{flex:1}.ds-copy>strong{font-size:26px}.ds-copy>span{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px;max-width:30ch}.ds-mobileSymbol{display:block;flex-shrink:0;color:#697380;margin-left:3px}.ds-destination[data-preview=true] .ds-mobileSymbol{color:#b62d25}.ds-destination>.ds-arrow{width:18px}}\n@media(max-width:370px){.ds-copy>strong{font-size:23px}.ds-copy>span{font-size:12px;max-width:27ch}.ds-destination{min-height:104px;gap:8px}.ds-mobileSymbol{width:27px;height:27px}.ds-destination>.ds-arrow{width:17px}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-arrow,.ds-copy{transition:none}.ds-destination:is(:hover,:focus-visible) .ds-copy{transform:none}}.ds-destination{cursor:pointer}.ds-destination:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #2c68b0;outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "More Disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native progressive disclosure for secondary workflow destinations.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-more\"><summary>Още <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></summary><div><button type=\"button\">3D карта</button><button type=\"button\">Специалисти</button></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-more{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif);position:relative;width:230px;color:#c0c7d4}.ds-more>summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;padding:10px 13px;font-size:12px;border-radius:8px;background:#111315}.ds-more>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-more[open]>div{position:relative;margin-top:8px;width:230px;padding:8px;background:#f6f5f1;color:#131518;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 18px 50px #0006;display:grid}.ds-more button{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif);min-height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 14px;text-align:left;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.ds-more button:hover{background:#e3e4df}.ds-more>summary:focus-visible,.ds-more button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7aa9e8;outline-offset:4px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-more[open]>div{animation:ds-more-arrival 160ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both}@keyframes ds-more-arrival{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-5px);filter:blur(3px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);filter:blur(0)}}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Task Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Clear workflow destinations, separate from optional exploration.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-task-nav\" aria-label=\"Работна област\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Задачи</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Реклами</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Видео</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Екип</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-task-nav{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif);display:flex;gap:5px;padding:0 0 17px;border-bottom:1px solid #343941;background:#111315}.ds-task-nav button{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif);display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;padding:12px 17px;min-height:48px;background:transparent;color:#c1c7d1;border:0;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-task-nav button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#f3f4f6;color:#20242c}.ds-task-nav button:hover{background:#2b3039;color:#fff}.ds-task-nav button[aria-pressed=true]:hover{background:#fff;color:#20242c}.ds-task-nav button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7aa9e8;outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-task-nav{gap:3px;justify-content:space-between}.ds-task-nav button{padding:12px 10px;gap:7px;font-size:13px;min-height:46px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Goal Demonstration Stage",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "goal-demonstration",
      "description": "The actual code-native sample publication in the single graphite stage. The other selected scenes show a flat service webpage, an inquiry with a prepared reply, or one task for focus. Every scene has a sample caption, is decorative, and is omitted on phones. App visibility gating enables the finite motion.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-preview\" data-playing=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-previewScene\" data-kind=\"content\"><div class=\"ds-contentPreview\"><div class=\"ds-publication\"><div class=\"ds-publicationHeader\"><span class=\"ds-brandMonogram\">A</span><span>AI Business Academy</span></div><div class=\"ds-publicationVisual\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216,40H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,56V200a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V56A16,16,0,0,0,216,40Zm0,160H40V56H216V200ZM184,96a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H80a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h96A8,8,0,0,1,184,96Zm0,32a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H80a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h96A8,8,0,0,1,184,128Zm0,32a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H80a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h96A8,8,0,0,1,184,160Z\"></path></svg><p>Покажи<br/><strong>как работиш.</strong></p><span class=\"ds-editorRule\"></span></div><div class=\"ds-publicationCaption\">Как започна. Какво пробва. Какво промени.</div></div><span class=\"ds-caption\">Примерна публикация</span></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-preview{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Manrope Variable\",Manrope,sans-serif)}\n.ds-preview{min-width:0;display:grid;align-items:center;justify-items:center;min-height:430px;padding:30px 24px;background:#191c20;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate}\n.ds-previewScene{width:100%;max-width:410px;min-height:370px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.ds-contentPreview{width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:25px}\n.ds-caption{font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#c4c8d0;text-align:center;max-width:34ch}\n.ds-publication{width:92%;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 15px 28px #0003}\n.ds-publicationHeader{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:15px 18px;color:#252931;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}\n.ds-brandMonogram{display:grid;place-items:center;width:25px;height:25px;border-radius:5px;background:#20242a;color:#fff;font-size:17px;font-weight:700}\n.ds-publicationVisual{background:#e6e9ed;color:#20242a;margin:0 9px;padding:23px 20px 22px;position:relative}\n.ds-publicationVisual>svg{color:#3e4652}\n.ds-publicationVisual p{font-size:clamp(28px,3.1vw,39px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:22px 0 24px}\n.ds-publicationVisual strong{font-weight:740;color:#b62d25}\n.ds-editorRule{display:block;width:40px;height:3px;background:#cf352c;transform-origin:left center}\n.ds-publicationCaption{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#5b6471;padding:15px 18px 19px;max-width:35ch}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){\n .ds-preview[data-playing=true] .ds-previewScene{animation:ds-exampleArrival 250ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}\n .ds-preview[data-playing=true] .ds-editorRule{animation:ds-editorRuleReveal 480ms 120ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both}\n @keyframes ds-exampleArrival{from{opacity:.55;transform:translateY(7px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}\n @keyframes ds-editorRuleReveal{from{transform:scaleX(.15)}to{transform:scaleX(1)}}\n}\n@media(max-width:1180px){.ds-preview{padding:28px 20px}.ds-publicationHeader{padding:14px}.ds-publicationVisual{padding:21px 17px}.ds-publicationVisual p{font-size:31px}}\n@media(max-width:760px){.ds-preview{display:none}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-previewScene,.ds-editorRule{animation:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A visible purpose, a direct action, an inspectable result.",
    "overview": "The operating product is a clear, adult workspace: a graphite shell establishes location, cool white paper makes the current work readable, and restrained red identifies an action or active detail. Manrope and the established silver-blue Academy logo carry the identity. Preserve that logo as an asset; do not redraw or recolor it to match the action accent.\n\nThis direction supersedes the earlier blue-glass and mountain treatment within the operating core. The optional spatial map, immersive learning surfaces and independent editing modules retain their own functional needs. Designs generated for a customer's website or brand establish their own visual identity; the Academy shell palette does not constrain those deliverables.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Clear location and a visible next action.",
      "Quiet graphite framing around readable working paper.",
      "Small red emphasis, with silver-blue identity and visible keyboard focus.",
      "Bounded, interruptible motion that respects reduced-motion preferences."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Action Rule",
        "body": "Red identifies a useful action or state; it does not flood the shell, replace the logo, or stand in for real progress.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Literal Label Rule",
        "body": "Navigation names the visible destination. Controls name their actual action. Saving, generating, reviewing, approving and publishing remain visibly distinct states.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Bounded Motion Rule",
        "body": "Motion explains a goal, acknowledges a press or distinguishes a temporary layer. Shell routes use an opacity-only arrival (180ms); ordinary color changes use (160ms). Home scenes arrive once and settle (250ms), fading from a small vertical offset (7px). The sample publication has one small rule reveal ending at (600ms). Direct actions remain usable throughout. Remove nonessential sequences, spatial movement and backdrop blur for reduced motion; never add continuous WebGL or background animation to entry.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the established silver-blue Academy logo.",
      "**Do** use graphite framing, cool paper and restrained red within the operating core.",
      "**Do** expose a direct next action and keep saved work reachable.",
      "**Do** let each sample settle, gate its motion when offscreen or in a hidden tab, and use large labels with simple icons on phones.",
      "**Do** retain visible keyboard focus, readable contrast, responsive controls and reduced-motion support.",
      "**Do** preserve the optional map and each editing module's independent behavior.",
      "**Do** give generated customer websites and brands their own appropriate visual identity."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** restore blue glass, mountain atmosphere, neon noise or a cluttered collage in the operating core.",
      "**Don't** require the 3D map, a preview tap, an animation to finish or an extra confirmation before the selected entry task.",
      "**Don't** obscure navigation, overload the first view, or duplicate supporting calls to action.",
      "**Don't** use invented activity, testimonials, progress or completed AI work as visual content.",
      "**Don't** equate a timer, preview, animation or selected map node with verified work, mastery or measured retention."
    ]
  }
}
